  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "sessionId": "ses_1777857796192_d5jdor",
    "questionId": "q11",
    "answer": {
      "bugs": [
        {
          "line": 3,
          "issue": "discount_percent = discount_percent 是空操作，没有进行百分比归一化。若传入20（表示20%），实际不会做任何转换，导致后续计算错误。",
          "fix": "discount_percent = discount_percent / 100"
        },
        {
          "line": 4,
          "issue": "price * discount_percent 计算的是「折扣金额」，而非「折后价格」。应为本金乘以(1 - discount_percent)。",
          "fix": "final_price = price * (1 - discount_percent)"
        },
        {
          "line": 5,
          "issue": "if final_price < 0：检查方向错误。final_price 在正常计算下永远不会是负数（正数乘以小于1的数）。应改为检查 price <= 0 或直接删除此行。",
          "fix": "if price <= 0: return 0"
        }
      ],
      "correctedCode": "def calculate_discount(price, discount_percent):\n    if discount_percent > 1:\n        discount_percent = discount_percent / 100\n    final_price = price * (1 - discount_percent)\n    if price <= 0:\n        return 0\n    return round(final_price, 3)"
    }
